# Booking UI conventions

- Styles live in `wwwroot/css/booking.css` with `guest-*` classes
- Behavior in `wwwroot/js/booking-ui.js` (modals, toasts, form preview)
- Available rooms come from server model (`BookingPageViewModel`), not mock arrays
- Keep hero image only on `.guest-hero`
- Preserve mobile nav toggle (`#guestNav` / `#guestNavToggle`)
- Logo on customer header → `Home/Index` unless user changes it
- No new CSS framework; extend existing guest styles
